title: "Perf Sentinel: I/O anti-pattern detection in OpenTelemetry traces, priced in energy and carbon"
abstract: "Perf Sentinel finds N+1 queries, redundant calls, slow queries and fanout in OpenTelemetry traces, as a CI quality gate or an OTLP daemon, then converts every avoidable I/O into energy and CO2."
